  "title": "Flutterwave Named Company of the Year at IPR, London",
  "summary": "London, United Kingdom 19th September, 2024 – Flutterwave, Africa’s leading payment technology company, has been named Company of the Year at the prestigious Innovation in Payments and Remittances (IPR) 2024 Awards held in London on September 17th, 2024. This recognition underscores Flutterwave’s unwavering commitment to excellence, innovation, and facilitating seamless cross-border payments for all individuals […]",
